                                "sense_id": "6ea6d21c-877c-31e9-bfd2-13d4650624cd",
                                "text": "Bruhle introduced him to me as the principal of the university, and the Eleutherarch."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "24ffe0a2-5232-4ae2-b457-1f1bb3b041fc",
                                "sense_id": "6ea6d21c-877c-31e9-bfd2-13d4650624cd",
                                "text": "He slept with Horrid Mysteries under his pillow, and dreamed of venerable eleutherarchs and ghastly confederates holding midnight conventions in subterranean caves."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8be15104-f76b-3952-80bd-881ae8ddc2f1",
